Z||000000||Screwie||10-25-2001||10:59 AM||||I was wondering, if you have Canadian citizenship, are you allowed to just go and work everywhere in the US as well? I mean, here in Europe we've got the EU, you can go and work in every EU country without getting extra permits or visas or whatever. Is there something like that between the US and Canada? Or do you need all kinds of visas or whatever, just like Europeans who want to work in the US?||||reg||1
